/Collection.md","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"Collection"}]},{"type":"text","value":";\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"path"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":"[];\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"sourceId?"},{"type":"text","value":": "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"string"},{"type":"text","value":";\n}"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The collection, its alias, and the path to the root field in this collection.\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"alias"},{"type":"text","value":" is the alias under which the resolved collection is referenced in the\nquery it was reached from (when the ref crosses into a joined source). It is\nleft undefined when the ref simply resolves to a field on the passed-in\n"},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"collection"},{"type":"text","value":", in which case the caller already knows the alias."}]}],"headings":[{"id":"parameters","text":"Parameters","level":2},{"id":"query","text":"query","level":3},{"id":"ref","text":"ref","level":3},{"id":"collection","text":"collection","level":3},{"id":"returns","text":"Returns","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\n```ts\nfunction followRef(\n   query, \n   ref, \n   collection): \n  | void\n  | {\n  alias?: string;\n  collection: Collection;\n  path: string[];\n  sourceId?: string;\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/ir.ts:378](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/ir.ts#L378)\n\nFollows the given reference in a query\nuntil its finds the root field the reference points to.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### query\n\n[`QueryIR`](../interfaces/QueryIR.md)\n\n### ref\n\n[`PropRef`](../classes/PropRef.md)\\<`any`\\>\n\n### collection\n\n[`Collection`](../../../../interfaces/Collection.md)\n\n## Returns\n\n  \\| `void`\n  \\| \\{\n  `alias?`: `string`;\n  `collection`: [`Collection`](../../../../interfaces/Collection.md);\n  `path`: `string`[];\n  `sourceId?`: `string`;\n\\}\n\nThe collection, its alias, and the path to the root field in this collection.\n`alias` is the alias under which the resolved collection is referenced in the\nquery it was reached from (when the ref crosses into a joined source). It is\nleft undefined when the ref simply resolves to a field on the passed-in\n`collection`, in which case the caller already knows the alias.\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: followRef\ntitle: followRef\n---\n\n```ts\nfunction followRef(\n   query, \n   ref, \n   collection): \n  | void\n  | {\n  alias?: string;\n  collection: Collection;\n  path: string[];\n  sourceId?: string;\n};\n```\n\nDefined in: [packages/db/src/query/ir.ts:378](https://github.com/TanStack/db/blob/main/packages/db/src/query/ir.ts#L378)\n\nFollows the given reference in a query\nuntil its finds the root field the reference points to.\n\n## Parameters\n\n### query\n\n[`QueryIR`](../interfaces/QueryIR.md)\n\n### ref\n\n[`PropRef`](../classes/PropRef.md)\\<`any`\\>\n\n### collection\n\n[`Collection`](../../../../interfaces/Collection.md)\n\n## Returns\n\n  \\| `void`\n  \\| \\{\n  `alias?`: `string`;\n  `collection`: [`Collection`](../../../../interfaces/Collection.md);\n  `path`: `string`[];\n  `sourceId?`: `string`;\n\\}\n\nThe collection, its alias, and the path to the root field in this collection.\n`alias` is the alias under which the resolved collection is referenced in the\nquery it was reached from (when the ref crosses into a joined source). It is\nleft undefined when the ref simply resolves to a field on the passed-in\n`collection`, in which case the caller already knows the alias.\n"}
